{"version":1,"content":"<p>中東，阿聯酋阿布扎比酋長皇宮酒店草坪上，比亞迪正式曝光了仰望旗下一款超豪華新車「鼎曜」YANGWANG ALTIOR。Altior源自拉丁語，意思是「更高」。這也是仰望品牌誕生以來，第一次脱離U7、U8、U9的字母數字序列，單獨起了一個名字。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585464.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.653985+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:13:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"ae5b5851fa0c448aaa0d401b5db0e6e71a349f51b817bf32cf85f9afc527d218","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}